9q4Tus5PuSJPtAby4pR-oBt6eHuZaUKs8gxKgJY_4hsJWw2AXlhrm-37ZDhMo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRMlN9gE0LSqfdiIVxasi2KiyUXHEyVpSdk3yL46gxOFQ&oe=6B047C66"}, "display_name": "MUA", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Wellness", "Meditation", "Health", "Relaxation"], "long_description": "# MUA, The Moment You Are.\n\nGuiding you into the state of **\ubb34\uc544\uc9c0\uacbd(Muajigyung)**, where you can experience the moment as you truly are. MUA recommends optimized meditation content based on your condition. By seamlessly transitioning between reality and the virtual world with dreamlike visuals, it allows you to meditate easily and conveniently anytime, anywhere. Through this process, you enter a deep immersive state and experience inner tranquility.\n\n- **\ubb34\uc544\uc9c0\uacbd(Muajigyung)**: Lose yourself in the moment. A deep state of immersion where you become free from all external distractions, even dissolving the boundaries between yourself and the world.\n\n# MUA offers two types of meditation experiences:\n\n{932528812407109}\n# XR Meditation\n\nXR meditation is categorized into Tea Ceremony, Space, and Body Scan Meditation. Through expert-guided narration, dreamlike visuals, and interactions, even beginners can easily reach a high level of immersion.\n\n{612923098146876}\n# Querencia Meditation\n\nQuerencia Meditation is not confined to predefined narration or settings. Instead, Querencia allows users to design their own meditation space, providing a peaceful retreat anytime, anywhere. \n\n**A Special Experience of Connecting with Your Inner Self**\n\n**Through MUA, embark on a profound journey into your inner world.**", "short_description": "MUA, The Moment You Are.\nMUA is an XR meditation guide service that analyzes bio/mind data to recommend personalized meditation programs, enhances immersive experience by seamless transitioning between reality and virtual worlds, and helps achieve inner stability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://muameditation.com/member/privacy.do", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NP Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://muameditation.com/main.do", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23863149006619614"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3849482555291230"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3849482555291230"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1741742580, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3849482555291230"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28125171463750659", "version": "2.3"}, "id": "1136135921343802", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9962138687147214", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28125171463750659"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795065360, "id": "30177503278517457", "version": "2.3", "version_code": 174, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"